flowchart TD
    Start([Start Chat Request]) --> Plan[Create Execution Plan]
    Plan --> Retrieve[Retrieve Relevant Memories]
    Retrieve --> Tools[Execute Authorized Tools]
    Tools --> Context[Build Provider Prompt Context]
    Context --> Model[Generate LLM Completion]
    Model --> Format[Format & Validate Output]
    Format --> Save[Save Durable Memory]
    Save --> End([Response Delivered])
